{"id":"edge-aloe","name":{"en":"Edge Aloe","ja":"剣先アロエ"},"desc":{"en":"A fleshy plant that adapted to harsh environments. It has evolved sharp thorns in order to prevent animals from dining on it regularly.","ja":"多肉植物の一種。厳しい環境化で育ったため か、他の動植物に食べられぬよう鋭いトゲが びっしり生えている。取り出すのは一苦労す るが、中の身は白くてほんのり甘い。"},"level":5,"locations":[{"id":"arland-great-plains","name":{"en":"Arland Great Plains","ja":"アーランド南方大平原"}},{"id":"arland-wastelands","name":{"en":"Arland Wastelands","ja":"アーランド東の荒野"}},{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}}],"traits":{"id":"sharp-edge","name":{"en":"Sharp Edge","ja":"鋭い切れ味"}},"categories":[{"id":"healing","name":{"en":"(Healing)","ja":"（薬品）"},"icon":"totori-category-healing"},{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"poison","name":{"en":"(Poison)","ja":"（毒の材料）"},"icon":"totori-category-poison"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"},{"id":"vegetable","name":{"en":"(Vegetable)","ja":"（食材・野菜）"},"icon":"totori-category-vegetable"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":8}